    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43944" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ-θᾱλής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, 
			Dor.
		
		Adj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flourishing, thriving</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύχα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					9.72
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέδον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					8.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκάρπεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					217
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρποί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					1062
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύλλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.313
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Anyte</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθηλής</span> is cj. ib. <i><span class="en">
				247
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
