				9
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔ-θᾰλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i>thriving
				well</i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				197.34
			</span></i>.</div>
